# Keep operational records and credentials out of this core-only repository.
**/node_modules/
**/test-data/
**/uploads/
**/qa/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vercel/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# The baseline compiled app is deliberately tracked alongside editable source.
# app/.gitignore continues to ignore newly generated dist files by default.
